From 6d8ff309e8b535a97501377898c2a3d0e2f0036c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:30:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: bird house trapping on Fossil Island

The four bird house spaces (multilocs on varps 1626-1629, the values RuneLite's
Time Tracking reads): build (or use a bird house on the space), add 10 seeds,
and after 50 minutes Empty or Reset for the clockwork, raw bird meat, feathers,
nests (the OSRS Wiki's seed-nest and nest-table chances) and the Hunter XP,
with the collect message RuneLite's Loot Tracker parses. Tier data in the
server-only dbtable birdhouse_types (56003, rows 60163-60171), server varps
63762-63769, ::birdhouses makes seeded houses full. Integration tests in
BirdHouseScriptTest. Needs patch 15 (the hunter module).
